        <h3>About Us</h3>
        <p>Hailing from the vibrant seaside city of Brighton, Princess Ugly is a five-piece band bringing a
            fresh twist to the sonic soundscapes of the musical landscape.
            Our collective experience is as eclectic as our sound, with backgrounds that span England and
            Europe—from construction sites to office desks and everything in between. This variety brings a
            fresh perspective to our songwriting and live performances, shaping a sound that’s truly
            one-of-a-kind.
            Catch us live in Brighton and beyond.</p>
